{"v":4,"desc":"Penko Park是一款以探索廢棄的野生動物園為主軸的遊戲。\n玩家藉由拍照和與這個世界互動，結識園中的神祕居民！ \n\n捕捉搶眼的畫面，看看這些生物能夠擺出哪些逗趣的姿勢。\n將野生動物的詳細資料和快照收錄到具有威信的遊園導覽書中。\n發掘該動物園的歷史、祕密和許多不為人知的祕境。\n用你可靠的Penko鉤爪手與環境互動。\n解鎖相機的鬼入鏡模式，踏入驚聳領域。","publisher":"Ghostbutter","release":"2022-09-28","genres":["模擬","冒險","動作","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","葡萄牙文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.1GB / Switch 1.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e81600a3eb22c5acbd751a222daaebde3a167f245bd1aeb53020b5621e5e79eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8f0ec32d961c5514f64451d3cbc69486e296d55df005d566ea18ea61532f273.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9fde16a1fabdf7caddceb311783df340f165e634d65352d097887d1a563a9f22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21ebac419675361af6159332814acfcdc91b59e5cd94f7ce2782b9ecd5b80f46.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f7f1a40b6cca26d56bb7bde1b9ef403830de091464013c1f835b93e32d25f2da.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f45f5295c028fdd5b0a7cca7b24ac761db88ca45a4799c799e8e2140747408d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ecc018998000","dlc":[]}